OL,3,AReform pledges to suspend asylum system
OL,4,Afor up to five years and deport
OL,5,Aclaimants
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform UK has announced plans to close
OL,8,Fdown the UK's asylum system for a full
OL,9,Fparliamentary term - which is five
OL,10,Fyears - if it were elected.
OL,12,FThe party said all new asylum
OL,13,Fapplications would be rejected and
OL,14,Fexisting applications voided, with all
OL,15,Fclaimants marked for deportation. It
OL,16,Fsaid no grants of humanitarian
OL,17,Fprotection or refugee status would be
OL,18,Fmade, while legal refugee routes and
OL,19,Fresettlement schemes would end.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
