OL,3,AReform pledges to suspend asylum system
OL,4,Afor up to five years and deport
OL,5,Aclaimants
OL,6,
OL,7,FReform said it would also scrap the
OL,8,Fasylum tribunal system and would deport
OL,9,F90,000 people currently with appeal
OL,10,Fcases.
OL,12,FLabour chair Bridget Phillipson called
OL,13,Fthe proposals a "clear sign of
OL,14,Fdesperation and weakness".
